@host=http://localhost:5000

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Get all users
GET {{host}}/api/users
X-Correlation-Id: learn-csharp-demo-001

### Get user by id
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
X-Correlation-Id: learn-csharp-demo-002

### Get missing user
GET {{host}}/api/users/999
X-Correlation-Id: learn-csharp-demo-003

### Create user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: learn-csharp-demo-004

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Diana",
  "email": "diana@example.com"
}
